+Backups (ADR-0037):
+
+```bash
+pd backup [--to URI] [--retention SPEC] [--no-prune]
+pd backup list  [--to URI]
+pd backup show <snapshot-id> [--to URI]
+pd backup prune [--to URI] [--retention SPEC]
